Subject: [PATCH 6/8] =?UTF-8?q?TV=20antiga=20(root):=20ao=20abrir,=20pede?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20ao=20Homebrew=20Channel=20a=20inicializa=C3=A7=C3=A3o=20do?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20root=20se=20ela=20n=C3=A3o=20rodou=20no=20boot?=
